# Trivy vulnerability ignore list — frontend container
# -------------------------------------------------------
# These CVEs are in node_modules within the built image. They are either
# development-only tools that don't run at runtime, or pinned transitively
# by eslint-config-next / Next.js internals.
# All are documented and tracked. Review before each expiry date.

# brace-expansion — pinned by eslint-config-next and Next.js build tooling.
# Does not run at runtime in the production Node.js server process.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-13149
CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152

# cross-spawn — build tool dependency pinned by eslint-config-next.
# Not reachable in production runtime.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2024-21538

# glob — pinned by Next.js internal tooling.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2025-64756

# ip-address — pinned by a deep transitive dep.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-69192

# minimatch — pinned by eslint-config-next.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-26996
